  "newSentences": [
    {
      "id": "03-assign-roles-1",
      "text": "灯只能留亮灭，累计数量需要由人记；个人记录不能直接共享，这套办法固定一名计数员，其余九十九人各只成功发一次，避免重复算人。",
      "take": "logic",
      "startSample": 1433208,
      "endSample": 2047708,
      "startFrame": 895.75,
      "endFrame": 1279.82,
      "tailCut": 0.42,
      "lufs": -15.8,
      "maxInnerSilenceS": 0.2,
      "trimmedSeconds": 12.802083333333334,
      "inputWavSHA256": "0b4efb7deb60128949813033fdf4ef401fe5c77badd2425d3e01d30dd8fa130f",
      "inputTextSHA256": "cdf7a39f390daf00bc030a44458e0d93f028f97151f7a6fa31118e71649bf229"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-send-once-1",
      "text": "灯亮时已有一份未收信号，再开也留不下第二份；发信人若擅自关灯，这份信号就会丢失。",
      "take": "logic",
      "startSample": 2384518,
      "endSample": 2772990,
      "startFrame": 1490.32,
      "endFrame": 1733.12,
      "tailCut": 0.45,
      "lufs": -15.8,
      "maxInnerSilenceS": 0.21,
      "trimmedSeconds": 8.093166666666667,
      "inputWavSHA256": "e62360d70c1d33c37b7a59665b20bafca31fa4e1668f0846c7855e4022690fc4",
      "inputTextSHA256": "b6033c460e6e0c111dc025f65319bfeea3c10035e9ac29aa413038532e0572e0"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-send-once-2",
      "text": "所以未发者只有遇到灭灯才开灯，并自己记住已发；遇亮还没发成功，就保留资格继续等，成功发过以后永不再开灯。",
      "take": "logic",
      "startSample": 2789790,
      "endSample": 3288633,
      "startFrame": 1743.62,
      "endFrame": 2055.4,
      "tailCut": 0.55,
